  "One-time charge cancelled. Your normal charge limit applies again.": "已取消单次充电，恢复常规充电限制。",
  "One-time charge completed. Your normal charge limit applies again.": "单次充电已完成，恢复常规充电限制。",
  "Calibration action: %s": "校准操作：%s",
