  "Error details: %s": "错误详情：%s",
  "A temporary charge-limit disable is in progress. To cancel the schedule, set a charge limit.": "正在临时暂停充电限制。重新设置上限即可取消倒计时。",
  "A temporary force discharge is in progress. To cancel the schedule and restore wall power, choose \"Stop Force Discharge\".": "正在临时主动放电。选择“停止主动放电”可取消倒计时并恢复适配器供电。",
  "Quit the batt menubar app.": "退出 batt 菜单栏应用。",
  "Power flow and charge status are updated every 10 seconds.": "功率流向与充电状态每 10 秒更新一次。",
  "\n3. An indefinite force discharge will continue until you stop it. Prefer a timed duration unless you specifically need indefinite discharge.": "\n3. 持续主动放电会一直运行到手动停止。通常建议选择限定时长。",
  "1. Keep the lid open unless \"Prevent Sleep when Adapter is Disabled\" is enabled. When using that option with the lid closed, keep your Mac monitored and never place it in a bag.\n2. Force Discharge cuts wall power, making your Mac run on battery power just as if it were unplugged. If the battery charge is exhausted, your Mac will shut down.": "1. 请保持上盖打开；若启用了“停用适配器时防止睡眠”，合盖运行时仍需有人看管，勿将 Mac 放入包内。\n2. 主动放电会切断适配器输入，改用电池供电；电池耗尽会导致关机。",
  "Calibration helps you calibrate your battery by automatically discharging and charging it according to best practices.\n\nbatt prevents idle sleep for the entire calibration session. Closing the lid or explicitly choosing Sleep can still force sleep.\n\nIt's recommended to run the calibration process every few months.": "自动执行放电、充满和恢复原充电范围的校准流程。\n\n校准期间 batt 会防止自动睡眠，但合盖或手动选择睡眠仍可能使系统暂停。可随时暂停或取消。",
  "Charge the battery once without changing your charge limit.\n\n\"Charge to <limit>% Now\" starts charging right away, even when the charge sits between the lower and the upper limit, and stops at the limit.\n\n\"Charge to Full Once\" charges to 100% and then restores your limit automatically.\n\nA one-time charge survives a restart. Cancel it here, or set a charge limit to cancel it.": "临时充电一次，不改变平时的充电范围。\n\n“立即充至上限”会马上充电，即使当前电量处于上下限之间；达到上限后停止。\n\n“临时充满一次”会充至 100%，随后自动恢复原限制。\n\n任务在后台重启后仍会保留。可在此取消，或重新设置充电上限。",
  "Cut power from the wall and run from the battery, either indefinitely or for a selected duration. After a temporary force discharge, batt automatically restores the power adapter.": "切断适配器输入，改用电池供电。可持续生效或指定时长；倒计时结束后自动恢复适配器。\n\n合盖外接显示器模式通常要求连接电源，因此切断供电可能使 Mac 睡眠。高级设置中的“停用适配器时防止睡眠”会影响此行为。",
  "Cut power from the wall and run from the battery, either indefinitely or for a selected duration. After a temporary force discharge, batt automatically restores the power adapter.\n\nNOTE: if you are using Clamshell mode (using a Mac laptop with an external monitor and the lid closed), *cutting power will cause your Mac to go to sleep* unless \"Prevent Sleep when Adapter is Disabled\" is enabled. This is a limitation of macOS. There are ways to prevent this, but it is not recommended for most users.": "切断适配器输入，改用电池供电。可持续生效或指定时长；倒计时结束后自动恢复适配器。\n\n合盖外接显示器模式通常要求连接电源，因此切断供电可能使 Mac 睡眠。高级设置中的“停用适配器时防止睡眠”会影响此行为。",
  "Disable MagSafe LED control. The LED will stay in its default state (mostly orange).": "停止自定义 MagSafe 灯色，将指示灯交由系统控制。",
  "Disable the battery charge limit and let your Mac charge to 100%, either indefinitely or for a selected duration. After a temporary disable, batt automatically restores your current limit.": "暂停充电限制，让 Mac 按系统规则充电至 100%。可持续生效或选择时长；临时暂停结束后，自动恢复原上限。",
  "Enable MagSafe LED control. The LED will reflect charging status:\n\n- Green: Charge limit is reached and charging is stopped.\n- Orange: Charging, discharging or calibration is in progress.\n- System: Sleep, unavailable data or an unconfirmed pause.": "按充电目标显示灯色：\n\n• 绿色：已达到目标，或在充电范围内保持。\n• 橙色：正在充电、主动放电或校准。\n• 未确认的暂停、睡眠和读取失败：交由系统控制。",
  "Force the MagSafe LED to stay off regardless of charging state.": "保持 MagSafe 指示灯关闭；睡眠或灯控不可用时仍交由系统控制。",
  "Install the batt daemon. batt daemon is a component that controls charging. You must enter your password to install it because controlling charging is a privileged action.": "安装负责实际控制充电的 batt 后台服务。安装涉及系统权限，需要输入管理员密码。",
  "Let batt control MagSafe LED to reflect the charging state of your MacBook (or force it off).\n\nNote that you must have a MagSafe LED on your MacBook to use this feature.": "让 MagSafe 指示灯反映充电目标状态，或保持关闭。\n\n需要可用的指示灯接口和已经验证的控制能力。固件模式下未经验证的灯控保持禁用。",
  "Quit the batt menubar app, but keep the batt daemon running.\n\nSince the batt daemon is still running, batt can continue to control charging. This is useful if you don't want the menubar icon to show up, but still want to use batt. When the client is not running, you can change batt settings using the command line interface (batt). To prevent the menubar app from starting at login, you can remove it in System Settings -> General -> Login Items & Extensions -> remove batt.app from the list (do NOT remove the batt daemon).\n\nIf you want batt to stop controlling charging, you can use the \"Disable Charge Limit\" command. To uninstall, you can use the \"Uninstall Daemon\" command in the Advanced menu.": "退出菜单栏应用，后台服务继续运行并控制充电。\n\n退出后仍可使用 batt 命令行调整设置。若不希望登录时启动菜单栏应用，可到“系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项与扩展”中移除 batt.app；请保留后台服务。\n\n若希望停止限充，请选择“暂停充电限制”；若要卸载，请在高级设置中选择“卸载后台服务”。",
  "Set whether to disable charging before sleep if charge limit is enabled.\n\nAs described in \"Prevent Idle Sleep when Charging\", batt will be paused by macOS when your computer goes to sleep, and there is no way for batt to continue controlling battery charging. This option will disable charging just before sleep, so your computer will not overcharge during sleep, even if the battery charge is below the limit.": "启用充电限制时，在进入睡眠前暂停充电。\n\n适用于由 batt 主动控制充电的模式：睡眠期间应用会暂停，提前停止可避免越过上限，即使当前电量尚未达到上限。固件模式下由固件继续执行限制，不需要此选项。",
  "Set whether to keep Clamshell mode alive while adapter input is disabled by temporarily disabling system sleep.\n\nThis prevents all sleep—not just idle sleep—while adapter input is disabled, allowing Force Discharge and Auto Calibration to continue with the lid closed. When adapter input returns, batt automatically restores the prior sleep setting.\n\nWARNING: Your Mac may remain awake with the lid closed, overheat in a bag, or drain its battery to 0% if unplugged and left unattended.": "停用适配器输入时，临时禁止系统睡眠，使合盖外接显示器模式下的主动放电和校准能够继续。恢复供电后自动还原此前的睡眠设置。\n\n注意：合盖后仍可能保持运行；请有人看管，勿放入包内，避免过热或电池耗尽。",
  "Set whether to prevent idle sleep during a charging session.\n\nDue to macOS limitations, batt will be paused when your computer goes to sleep. As a result, when you are in a charging session and your computer goes to sleep, there is no way for batt to stop charging (since batt is paused by macOS) and the battery will charge to 100%. This option, together with \"Disable Charging before Sleep\", will prevent this from happening.\n\nThis option tells macOS NOT to go to sleep when the computer is in a charging session, so batt can continue to work until charging is finished. Note that it will only prevent **idle** sleep, when 1) charging is active 2) battery charge limit is enabled. So your computer can go to sleep as soon as a charging session is completed.\n\nHowever, this options does not prevent manual sleep (limitation of macOS). For example, if you manually put your computer to sleep (by choosing the Sleep option in the top-left Apple menu) or close the lid, batt will still be paused and the issue mentioned above will still happen. This is where \"Disable Charging before Sleep\" comes in.": "在 batt 主动控制充电期间防止自动睡眠。\n\n某些控制模式下，应用在睡眠时无法继续控制充电；此选项与“睡眠前暂停充电”配合使用。仅在已连接适配器、已启用限制且正在充电时阻止自动睡眠，充电结束后恢复。\n\n此选项不阻止合盖或通过苹果菜单手动睡眠。固件模式下不需要此功能。",
  "Set whether to prevent system sleep during a charging session (experimental).\n\nThis option tells macOS to create power assertion, which prevents sleep, when all conditions are met:\n\n1) charging is active\n2) battery charge limit is enabled\n3) computer is connected to charger.\nSo your computer can go to sleep as soon as a charging session is completed / charger disconnected.\n\nDoes similar thing to prevent-idle-sleep, but works for manual sleep too.\n\nNote: please disable disable-charging-pre-sleep and prevent-idle-sleep, while this feature is in use": "充电时防止系统睡眠（实验性）。\n\n在已连接适配器、启用充电限制且正在充电时，向系统申请保持唤醒；充电完成或断开适配器后恢复睡眠。\n\n此功能也影响手动睡眠。使用时请关闭“睡眠前暂停充电”和“充电时防止自动睡眠”。",
  "This enables macOS’s global no-sleep setting while adapter input is disabled. Your Mac may remain awake with the lid closed, overheat in a bag, or drain its battery. Use this only when the Mac is monitored. Continue?": "这会在停用适配器输入时临时禁止系统睡眠。Mac 合盖后仍可能运行、在包内过热或耗尽电池。请仅在有人看管时使用。是否继续？",
  "This will:\n1. Discharge to 15% by default.\n2. Charge to 100%.\n3. Hold at full charge (for 2 hours by default).\n4. Discharge back to previous charge limit.\n\nNOTES:\n• batt will prevent idle sleep until calibration finishes, is cancelled, or fails.\n• You can pause or cancel anytime from the menu.\n• Highly recommend keeping your Mac connected to power throughout the process to prevent the battery level from dropping below the threshold without timely charging.\n• Closing the lid or explicitly choosing Sleep can still force sleep unless \"Prevent Sleep when Adapter is Disabled\" is enabled. When using that option with the lid closed, keep your Mac monitored and never place it in a bag.": "将执行以下流程：\n1. 默认放电至 15%。\n2. 充电至 100%。\n3. 保持满电（默认 2 小时）。\n4. 放电并恢复此前的充电上限。\n\n注意：\n• 完成、取消或失败前，batt 会防止自动睡眠。\n• 可随时从菜单暂停或取消。\n• 建议全程连接电源，以便及时恢复充电。\n• 合盖或手动睡眠可能暂停流程。若启用了“停用适配器时防止睡眠”，请有人看管，勿放入包内。",
  "Uninstall the batt daemon. This will remove the batt daemon from your system. You must enter your password to uninstall it.\n\nAfter uninstalling the batt daemon, no charging control will be present on your system and your Mac will charge to 100% as normal. The menubar app will still be present, but all options will be disabled. You can remove the menubar app by moving it to the trash.": "卸载 batt 后台服务，需要管理员密码。\n\n卸载后，batt 不再控制充电，系统将恢复正常充电。菜单栏应用仍会保留，可将其移入废纸篓。",
  "Your batt daemon is not compatible with this client version and needs to be upgraded. This is usually caused by a new client version that requires a new daemon version. You can upgrade the batt daemon by running this command.": "后台服务与此客户端版本不兼容，需要升级。升级后才能使用新版功能。",
  "DischargeToThreshold": "放电至校准下限",
  "ChargeToFull": "充电至满电",
  "HoldAfterFull": "保持满电",
  "DischargeAfterHold": "放电至原上限",
  "RestoreAndFinish": "恢复设置并完成",
  "Error": "出错",
  "Schedule": "设置校准计划",
  "ScheduleUpcoming": "校准即将开始",
  "ScheduleDisable": "关闭校准计划",
  "ScheduleSkip": "跳过本次校准",
  "SchedulePostpone": "推迟校准",
  "ScheduleError": "校准计划出错",
  "LED release failed; system control could not be confirmed": "指示灯恢复失败，尚未确认已交回系统",
  "Enable (Firmware Mode)": "启用（固件模式）",
  "This platform passed administrator LED write/readback and visible-color checks. Firmware charge limits remain unchanged. Long-term sleep and reconnect behavior still needs observation; failures return control to the system.": "当前配置已通过管理员灯色读写和实际变色测试，继续使用固件限充。睡眠、重新连接及长时间运行的表现仍需观察；出现异常时会交回系统控制。"
}
